  [
    id 11
    label "5FHlzGOsueE"
    step 0
    date "2022-07-18T08:40:59Z"
    title "Andes Engineers Microbes Against Climate Change"
    description "Meet Andes Ag, a Leaps portfolio company that is working on #biotech breakthroughs that could help make Leap 03/ Reduce the environmental impact of agriculture a reality. Meet co-founders Gonzalo Fuenzalida and Tania Timmermann&#8239;Aranis and learn how their passion for engineering microbes could change the world for the better.&#8239;&#8239; &#10;&#10;About Andes:&#8239;&#8239; &#10;Andes empowers microbes by engineering them and has developed a process for seamlessly integrating microbes into the agriculture process. Its #Microprimetechnology reduces the need for synthetic nitrogen fertilizers by integrating seeds with a unique library of microbes that colonize the seed&#8217;s root structure and kick start the nitrogen fixation process, enabling crops to draw nitrogen from the air.&#8239;&#8239; &#10;&#10;Andes is also developing microbial strains for nature-based permanent carbon capture solutions to sequester and store CO2 from the atmosphere into the soil. This initially focuses on capturing carbon via microbial-powered corn crops. If deployed successfully at scale, it could capture several gigatons of carbon a year.&#8239;&#8239;&#8239; &#10;&#10;Learn more:&#8239; &#10;https://leaps.bayer.com/companies?show_modal=46  &#10;https://www.andes.bio/&#8239;&#8239; &#10;&#10;About Leaps by Bayer:&#8239;&#8239;&#8239; &#10;Leaps by Bayer invests in paradigm-shifting advances in the life sciences &#8211; targeting the breakthroughs that could fundamentally change the world for the better. Our approach is making significant and sustained investments in disruptive biotechnologies that could have the greatest impact on humanity.&#8239;&#8239;&#8239;  &#10;&#10;Discover more of Leaps: &#10;Our 10 Leaps: https://bit.ly/Our10Leaps_&#10;Meet our Portfolio Companies: https://bit.ly/LeapsPortfolioCompanies_&#10;Our Engagement: https://leaps.bayer.com/engagement &#10; &#10;Connect with us:&#8239;&#8239;&#8239; &#10;https://leaps.bayer.com/ https://twitter.com/leapsbybayer&#8239;&#8239; &#10;https://www.linkedin.com/company/leapsbybayer/&#8239;&#8239; &#10;&#10;Subscribe to our channel for more on breakthroughs in health and agriculture:&#8239;&#8239;&#8239; &#10;https://bit.ly/2PJvazz&#10;&#10;#Microbes"
