    description "Around the world a growing number of rivers, mountains, nature reserves, even marshes have all been given legal rights.&#10;&#10;Subscribe - https://www.youtube.com/bbcworldservice&#10;&#10;It&#8217;s an idea that&#8217;s being tested in courtrooms around the world. But to what extent might this help reduce the worst impacts of climate change and help us adapt to a warmer and wetter world?&#10;&#10;Find more videos on climate change and the environment here: https://www.youtube.com/playlist?list=PLz_B0PFGIn4dlFahw2svjb6-aW_BVOn4x&#10;&#10;Website: https://www.bbc.co.uk/worldserviceradio&#10;Twitter: https://twitter.com/bbcworldservice&#10;Facebook: https://facebook.com/bbcworldservice&#10;&#10;#bbcworldservice #climatechange #nature"
