    date "2021-11-01T01:56:17Z"
    title "Climate Change Song"
    description "A song that helps kids understand global warming and what we all need to do about it today.&#10;Subscribe! &#10140; https://www.youtube.com/c/hopscotchsongs?sub_confirmation=1&#10;Visit the Hopscotch Shop! &#10140; https://www.hopscotchsongs.com/shop&#10;&#10;Check out what our sponsors, Octopus Electric Vehicles, are doing to help! &#10140; https://www.octopusev.com/post/cop26-oev &#10;&#10;Download the song &#10140; https://www.hopscotchsongs.com/shop/climate-change-song-mp3&#10;Karaoke/backing track &#10140; https://www.hopscotchsongs.com/shop/climate-change-song-backing-track&#10;&#10;Stream on:&#10;Spotify &#10140; https://open.spotify.com/album/1gebSBNELKsw0WFKOREBgH&#10;Apple Music &#10140; https://music.apple.com/us/album/climate-change-song-single/1593491150?uo=4&#38;app=apple+music&#10;Amazon Music &#10140; https://www.amazon.com/gp/product/B09KZJLQDD&#10;...and much more (check your favorite streaming site)!&#10;&#10;Voices&#10;Earth and Factory: Matt Pace&#10;Kids: Lucy, Gracie, Rachel, and Charlotte&#10;Soloist: Sha'Air - https://shaairhawkins.com&#10;Chorus: Joanna Pace, Amy, Emmalynn Pace, Debra Pace, Bart Pace&#10;&#10;Song by Matt &#38; Joanna Pace, in partnership with Octopus Electric Vehicles&#10;Video animated by Dakota Sheperd and Jason McNeil&#10;Title animation by Brenden Nelson&#10;&#10;What do you think about this song? Reach out! &#8595;&#10;Instagram: https://www.instagram.com/hopscotchsongs&#10;Twitter: https://twitter.com/hopscotchsongs&#10;Facebook: https://www.facebook.com/hopscotchsongs&#10;Website: https://www.hopscotchsongs.com&#10;&#10;Lyrics:&#10;We&#8217;ll stop chopping down our trees!&#10;Stop using plastic things!&#10;We&#8217;ll carpool and drive EVs&#10;And give back to the Earth we&#8217;ve been given&#10;&#10;Cut down the milk and meat!&#10;Green power the lights and heat!&#10;We&#8217;ll sing this song on repeat&#10;As we do our part for the world that we live in&#10;&#10;Earth:&#10;I&#8217;m Earth, the planet that you&#8217;re on, you know &#10;But I&#8217;m not feeling so well.&#10;My temperature&#8217;s rising, species are dying,&#10;Floods, droughts, and fires &#10;No longer surprising&#10;&#10;I&#8217;m losing trees and my islands &#10;Slowly disappear&#10;It&#8217;s getting harder and harder&#10;To make a home for you here&#10;&#10;Factory:&#10;Hey Earth, let me break it down for &#8216;em:&#10;We&#8217;re making those greenhouse gasses &#10;Trapping heat in the atmosphere&#10;They come from cars and plastics&#10;Cows and factories here.&#10;&#10;We&#8217;re burning oil and coal&#10;And all that natural gas&#10;Releasing carbon dioxide and methane&#10;And releasing them fast,&#10;But hey, folks gotta live. Yea!&#10;&#10;Earth: &#10;People need to live&#10;But look at what you give&#10;To the children after you&#10;You need me - ooh&#10;And I need you&#10;&#10;Kid 1:&#10;Hey! We&#8217;ll stop chopping down our trees&#10;They absorb carbon dioxide&#10;&#10;Kid 2:&#10;We&#8217;ll switch over to EVs&#10;Or carpool or go for a bike ride&#10;&#10;Kid 3:&#10;We&#8217;ll stop using plastic things&#10;And take our own bags to the store&#10;&#10;Kid 4:&#10;Let&#8217;s change up the way we eat - a little less milk and meat&#10;&#10;Cow:&#10;*Burp*&#10;&#10;Kid 5:&#10;Let&#8217;s switch to renewable power &#10;unplug and take shorter showers&#10;(But please don&#8217;t stop taking showers. That would be gross.)&#10;&#10;Kids:&#10;Stop chopping down our trees!&#10;Stop using plastic things!&#10;Carpool and drive EVs&#10;And give back to the Earth we&#8217;ve been given&#10;&#10;Cut down the milk and meat!&#10;Green power the lights and heat!&#10;And sing this song on repeat&#10;As we do our part for the world that we live in&#10;&#10;Kids:&#10;&#8220;Grown-ups, take it away!&#8221;&#10;&#10;Adults:&#10;We can write our governments&#10;And tell them to change &#10;They might say it&#8217;s impossible&#10;But we can hold them responsible &#10;&#10;And help them to lead in&#10;Cleaner energy&#10;What we do now will reverberate&#10;For centuries!&#10;&#10;We&#8217;ll stop chopping down our trees!&#10;Stop using plastic things!&#10;We&#8217;ll carpool and drive EVs&#10;And give back to the Earth we&#8217;ve been given&#10;&#10;Cut down the milk and meat!&#10;Green power the lights and heat!&#10;We&#8217;ll sing this song on repeat&#10;As we do our part for the world that we live in&#10;&#10;(Repeat with EVERYBODY)&#10;&#10;And we&#8217;ll start today!&#10;&#10;Today, today, today, today&#10;&#10;We&#8217;ll sing this song on repeat&#10;As we do our part for the world that we live in&#10;And we&#8217;ll start today&#10;&#10;Copyright &#169; 2021 Hopscotch&#10;&#10;#GetAMoveOn #savetheseas #teamseas #savethetrees #savetheplanet #savetheearth #teamtrees #climatechange #globalwarming #recycle #recyclingsongsforkids #songsforkids #protecttheenvironment"
