    title "IELTS Speaking Practice Live Lessons - Topic CLIMATE CHANGE"
    description "&#128073; Learn how to prepare for IELTS Speaking, without the stress!https://social.keithspeakingacademy.com/7n98?src=YTREC&#10;&#10;&#10;*****&#10;&#10;Hello there, hi and good morning, it's Keith from the Keith Speaking Academy - great to see you, come in and have a seat. Today we are going to be looking at the really interesting topic of Climate Change. Sometimes called Global Warming - I think it's more or less the same thing, although the scientists do see a bit of a difference.  We are going to be looking at Climate Change, language, vocabulary, pronunciation and above all ideas, so that you've got plenty to talk about if this topic comes up in IELTS Speaking - the most likely place it will come up is in Part 3. &#10;&#10;*****&#10;&#10;Topics covered in this video:&#10;&#10;00:00:00 Welcome&#10;0:02:20 Some Ideas &#38; Tips&#10;0:05:35 Focus on Language&#10;0:08:37 Vocabulary&#10;0:10:42 Climate vs Weather&#10;0:15:43 Pointers&#10;0:22:47 Nitty-gritty questions&#10;0:23:39 Causes of climate change&#10;0:37:26 Ideas on what causes climate change&#10;0:51:43 Model Answers&#10;1:01:29 Vocabulary Review - Kahoot time&#10;1:13:10 Topic for next session&#10;&#10;Reference for science-sparks.com: https://www.science-sparks.com/&#10;&#10;*****&#10;&#10;&#10;Get FREE IELTS SPEAKING practice online with my LIVE LESSONS streamed every Tuesday and Thursday at 9am (UK time) &#10;&#10;10:00 am (Spain)&#10;11:00 am (Russia/KSA)&#10;1:00 pm (Pakistan)&#10;1:30 pm (India)&#10;2:00 pm (Bangladesh)&#10;3:00 pm (Vietnam/Thailand)&#10;4:00 pm (Beijing, Taipei, H.K.)&#10;&#10;*****&#10;&#10;Do a complete Mock IELTS Test. &#10;https://takeielts.net/the-path-to-success-in-the-ielts-test/&#10;Use the CODE: keith10 to get a 10% discount&#10;&#10;FREE Lesson Notes in PDF https://keithspeakingacademy.com/ielts-speaking-free-live-lessons/&#10;&#10;FREE e-book: AVOID 10 MOST COMMON MISTAKES IN IELTS SPEAKING:&#10;https://keithspeakingacademy.com/&#10;&#10;*****&#10;&#10;Follow me on social media&#10;&#10;Facebook Group: https://www.facebook.com/groups/KeithIELTSMastermind/ &#10;&#10;Instagram: https://www.instagram.com/keith_speaking_academy/&#10;&#10;Website:  https://keithspeakingacademy.com/&#10;&#10;#ieltsspeaking2020  #ieltsspeakingtips #ieltsspeaking &#10;&#10;&#10;*****&#10;&#10;Donate and support my work :&#10;https://keithspeakingacademy.com/ielts-speaking-free-live-lessons/&#10;&#10;*****&#10;&#10;For those of you with the test coming soon&#10;&#10;Good luck!&#10;&#10;Keith"
