    description "#globalwarming  #animatedchemistry #climatechange &#10;Global Warming and Climate Change&#10;Chapters:&#10;0:00 Kinetic school's intro  &#10;0:22 Global Warming&#10;0:39 Why Earth surface is warming?&#10;4:45 Contributors of the Greenhouse gases&#10;5:33 Impacts of the Global warming&#10;6:04 Effects on Ocean and Climate change&#10;7:22  Ocean Acidification&#10;7:40 Coral bleaching&#10;8:07 Effects on Animals&#10;8:47 Effects on Human Health&#10;&#10;More videos:&#10;What are the &#8220;Greenhouse Gases&#8221; and &#8220;Greenhouse Effect&#8221;? Explained.&#10;https://youtu.be/LcDR_1Swg-A&#10;Layers of the Atmosphere&#10;https://youtu.be/KXf39bQH6iE&#10;How Lightning Forms &#10;https://youtu.be/IIaG0OjbJKs &#10;How Satellite Works &#10;https://youtu.be/n70zjMvm8L0 &#10;Photochemical Smog &#10;https://youtu.be/CWsGwtiiSio &#10;Acid Rain &#10;https://youtu.be/dmgLESI4GGU &#10;Sources of Air Pollution &#10;https://youtu.be/JmIYD6qjQ-k &#10;Air Pollution &#10;https://youtu.be/jtiANpcpJJY &#10;How Battery Works &#10;https://youtu.be/6p6UkwbEdtQ &#10;Corrosion : Factors Affecting Corrosion (Chapter 1) &#10;https://youtu.be/voKRXIZjzvQ &#10;Corrosion : Dry or Chemical Corrosion (Chapter 2) &#10;https://youtu.be/I3QLMl1AK9Y &#10;Corrosion : Electrochemical Cell or Corrosion Cell (Chapter 3) &#10;https://youtu.be/KdYWfaUS4uA &#10;Corrosion : Types of Electrochemical Cells (Chapter 4) &#10;https://youtu.be/PAfZ6-ycZw4 &#10;Corrosion : Rusting of Iron (Chapter 5) &#10;https://youtu.be/YDJJtfHc-H8&#10;&#10;Global Warming:&#10;Global Warming is a climatological phenomenon in which the global temperature is rising because of  increasing concentrations of&#160;greenhouse gases in the&#160;atmosphere."
