    title "No, Kurzgesagt, We WONT Fix Climate Change - The Danger of Fake Optimism"
    description "A rebuttal to Kurzgesagt's misleading video about 'staying hopeful' on climate change.&#10;We WILL Fix Climate Change! By Kurzgesagt: https://youtu.be/LxgMdjyw8uw&#10;Support me on Patreon: https://patreon.com/BadEmpanada&#10;Twitch stream: https://twitch.tv/BadEmpanada&#10;Follow my Instagram: https://instagram.com/BadEmpanada&#10;Become a member on YouTube: https://www.youtube.com/BadEmpanada/join&#10;One-time donations: https://ko-fi.com/BadEmpanada&#10;Second Channel: https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCjY9R3_6sxfUViabj93Vnhw&#10;&#10;Sources:&#10;[1] https://www.bbc.com/news/science-environment-61383391&#10;[2] Extreme heat waves under 1.5 &#176;C and 2 &#176;C global warming, Alessandro Dossio, et al.&#10;[3] Differential climate impacts for policy-relevant limits to global warming: the case of 1.5&#9702;C and 2&#9702;C, Carl-Friedrich Schleussner, et al.&#10;[4] https://www.carbonbrief.org/interactive-what-will-2c-and-4c-of-warming-mean-for-global-sea-level-rise/&#10;[5] https://www.npr.org/2022/05/18/1099733752/famine-africa-ukraine-invasion-drought&#10;[6] Climate Change and Right to Development, Vivek Mukherjee &#38; Faizan Mustafa.&#10;[7] The Good, the Bad and the Ugly: Who is Who in the Fight Against Climate Change, Miren Gutierrez.&#10;[8] https://www.unhcr.org/uk/news/latest/2016/11/581f52dc4/frequently-asked-questions-climate-change-disaster-displacement.html&#10;[9] https://www.theguardian.com/environment/2020/sep/09/climate-crisis-could-displace-12bn-people-by-2050-report-warns&#10;[10] https://www.pewresearch.org/global/2016/08/02/number-of-refugees-to-europe-surges-to-record-1-3-million-in-2015/&#10;[11] https://ednh.news/migrants-walls-go-up-around-fortress-europe/&#10;[12] https://ec.europa.eu/clima/eu-action/international-action-climate-change/climate-negotiations/paris-agreement_en&#10;[13] https://climateactiontracker.org/press/global-update-projected-warming-from-paris-pledges-drops-to-two-point-four-degrees/&#10;[14] https:/