    id 321
    label "wVo4Yx-yC3A"
    step 0
    date "2022-07-10T13:16:05Z"
    title "OUT OF CONTROL SITUATION"
    description "Life threatening! China is at risk. Australia underwater!&#10;Increased danger! Flooding in Australia. Typhoon Chaba in China&#10;JULY 2&#10;A devastating earthquake occurred in the south of Iran. After the main shock with a magnitude of 6.1, numerous aftershocks with a magnitude of up to 6.3 were recorded. The epicenter of the earthquake lay at a depth of 10 km. Unfortunately, there are dead and many injured. Rescue work continues.&#10;&#10;Climate catastrophes and eyewitness accounts of them, see the new issue of Breaking News.&#10;&#10;AT THE BEGINNING OF JULY&#10;BRAZIL, in the country's northwest, heavy rains and flooding have forced tens of thousands of residents to flee their homes. Unfortunately, there are dead and missing.&#10;&#10;JULY 1&#10;TURKEY. In the province of Artvin, the rains caused a massive landslide. Fragments of rocks fell on several trucks and literally crushed the cars. Unfortunately, there are dead and seriously injured.&#10;&#10;IN THE SAME DAY&#10;POLAND. Several people were injured as a result of the storm, which passed through most of the country. Downpours, strong winds, hail in places, caused broken trees, damaged roofs and flooded basements. More than 40,000 households experienced power outages.&#10;&#10;&#10;JULY 1 AND 2&#10;Central America. Tropical Storm Bonnie brought strong winds and heavy rain. The storm caused flash floods and landslides. The dead are reported. The injured were evacuated.&#10;The storm then intensified to a Category 3 hurricane, causing large storm surges and heavy rainfall along the Mexican coast.&#10;&#10;JULY 2, 2022&#10;CHINA, Typhoon Chaba hit the coast of Guangdong province. The storm was accompanied by heavy rains, wind gusts up to 160 km/h and caused 3 tornadoes in different regions of the country.&#10;Off the coast of Hong Kong, the elements broke the engineering ship in two, which was at the epicenter of the typhoon. More than two dozen crew members are missing. Search and rescue work continues.&#10;In the city of Taiyuan, Shanxi Province, a sudden downpour flooded roads in places to a depth of more than a meter, and a large number of cars were under water.&#10;&#10;JULY 1 TO 3&#10;ROMANIA. Severe storms, hail, thunderstorms and showers passed through several regions of the country. The cities of Craiova and Slatina suffered the most. The currents of water on the streets were so strong that dozens of cars were swept away from the parking lots.&#10;&#10;JULY 3, 2022&#10;NEW SOUTH WALES, AUSTRALIA. Due to the most powerful flooding in the eastern part of the country, tens of thousands of people were forced to leave their homes. The amount of rainfall has reached almost half of the average annual rainfall in Sydney. Many bridges were blocked, transport links were disrupted.&#10;&#10;On this day&#10;YEMEN, in the capital, heavy rain and hail flooded the streets in the southern part of the city.&#10;&#10;In the same day&#10;ITALY. In the Dolomites, an avalanche of snow, ice and rocks at a speed of about 300 kilometers per hour swept down the slope, where at that time there were many tourists. Unfortunately, several people died. There are injured and missing.&#10;The cause of the collapse was abnormal heat for these places. On the day of the tragedy, the temperature at the top of Marmolada exceeded 10&#8304;&#1057;.&#10;The next day, a strong hurricane hit the city of Cremona.&#10;&#10;From 3 to 5 JULY&#10;ECUADOR, floods and landslides destroyed houses. There are dead. Due to damage to the water supply network, 20,000 people were left without drinking water.&#10;&#10;4TH OF JULY&#10;MALAYSIA, after a heavy downpour in the state of Kedah, a large-scale flood occurred - overflowing rivers flooded more than 10 villages. Over 1400 people were evacuated.&#10;&#10;JULY 6, 2022&#10;ANDORRA. A heavy downpour with hail, accompanied by powerful gusts of wind, hit the city. Icy streams rushed through the streets, sweeping away everything in their path.&#10;&#10;In the same day&#10;On another continent, in the state of OHIO, USA, a powerful tornado swept through. He destroyed many houses and structures. Some of the buildings were destroyed to the ground. About 50,000 people were left without electricity.&#10;&#10;It's like news from the front!&#10;Every day people face climate attacks and suffer losses!&#10;Are people ready for such elements? Will they be able to protect themselves and their families?&#10;Do you know what to do if your house collapses?&#10;Can you even be sure that you will be saved?&#10;We pay attention to anything, but do not prepare for the inevitable cataclysms.&#10;&#10;&#171;GLOBAL CRISIS. WE ARE PEOPLE. WE WANT TO LIVE&#187; | International Online Forum | 07.05.2022&#10;https://youtu.be/qzVoa23zEvs&#10; &#10;Official website of the Creative Society project&#10;https://creativesociety.com&#10;&#10;&#8220;Creative society. Questions and answers&#34;&#10;https://youtu.be/BAsk7a9hkzA&#10;&#10;  E-mail: info@creativesociety.com&#10;#ClimateCrisis &#10;#ClimateChange&#10;#TornadoNetherlands #Anomalousheatwave &#10;#StormEurope &#10;#heatinchina&#10;#landslidesinchina&#10;#floodingcountyingeorgia&#10;#stormanddownpourinoman&#10;#floodingincolombia&#10;#hailingreece&#10;#floodinginturkey&#10;#tornadoinzierikzeenetherlands&#10;#czechrepublicstorm&#10;#heatwaveinitaly"
