    title "Are YOU really to blame for Climate Change?"
    description "The narrative around climate change often focuses on what you can do as an individual. This makes climate change personal, it becomes a polarising topic between colleagues, friends and family and often lets many of the real culprits of the hook. In this video we explore the complex maze of who is to blame for climate change and who has the power and responsibility to fix it.&#10;Every single purchase, conversation and election can be a small step on the way to ultimately solving this problem. Our goal with this video is to simply shake you up a bit and get you out of that depressive feeling of climate guilt. No Climate change is not your fault and No Climate change is not only your responsibility! However, you do have an opportunity to engage this issue on all levels and try to bring about all the change we so desperately need.&#10;&#10;&#128588; Subscribe to Mossy Earth: https://www.youtube.com/c/MossyEarth?sub_confirmation=1&#10;&#10;START REWILDING OUR PLANET TODAY&#10;===============================&#10;With us, you will restore nature and fight climate change every month&#10;&#127794; Plant native trees to capture carbon&#10;&#128058; Rewild habitats to support biodiversity&#10;&#128009; Support underfunded species and ecosystems&#10;&#10;Become a Mossy Earth Member: https://mossy.earth !"
