    title "Get PAID to Help Solve Climate Change (2022)"
    description "#climatecareer #climatechange #climatejobs&#10;Finding climate change jobs in 2022 has never been easier. Your climate career could be just around the corner as more companies focus on climate solutions. Careers in climate change are rapidly growing and this is the beginning of an exponential growth in climate careers and climate tech. Investment in climate solutions and climate tech has reached its highest level in 2022. Climate change is one of the most challenging global problem our species is facing. We can now find a fulfilling career to help solve climate change. Multiple resources for finding your climate career have been featured in this video such as Climatebase, Work on Climate Slack, Terra.do, and Green Jobs Boards. &#10;This video enables you to explore environmental and climate careers via the pointers on climate change jobs and search tools.&#10;&#10;Find Climate Solutions Oriented Jobs and Companies&#10;1. Climatebase - https://climatebase.org/&#10;2. Work on Climate - https://workonclimate.org/&#10;3. Climate Solutions at Work - https://drawdown.org/publications/cli...&#10;4. Terra.do for Climate Careers - https://www.terra.do/&#10;&#10;Here are a few more resources which are meant for specific environmental jobs. &#10;1. Green Jobs Network - Greenjobs.net&#10;2. Wise Oceans - https://www.wiseoceans.com/jobs/&#10;3. Conservation job board - https://www.conservationjobboard.com/&#10;4. Climate People - https://www.climatepeople.com/&#10;5. Josh&#8217;s Water jobs board - https://www.joshswaterjobs.com/jobs/&#10;&#10;Feel free to donate to the channel here - https://www.buymeacoffee.com/ankurshah13&#10;_____________________________________&#10;This channel is dedicated to environmental issues and solutions. The content is focused on how we can improve our relationship with our planet and become more conscious human beings.&#10;&#10;Follow me on Twitter - http://twitter.com/ankshah13&#10;Follow me on Instagram - http://instagram.com/ankshah13/&#10;Follow my page on Facebook - http://facebook.com/MotherSpaceshipEarth&#10;&#10;Subscribe here: https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCImIJxyJRQeAmh8F8J2vV0Q?sub_confirmation=1"
