    id 364
    label "HZVZDE1GfFA"
    step 0
    date "2017-10-18T16:30:00Z"
    title "Is Climate Change a Hoax?"
    description "Is climate change real? Is it a hoax? Let&#8217;s review what scientists in their field of study have concluded and try to gain an unbiased basic understanding of what is happening to our planet. &#10;&#10;Peer-reviewed scientific journals, preferably written by scientists holding doctorates within their relevant fields of study, such as Climatology, Meteorology, Geology, and any other relevant interdisciplinary fields within physics, chemistry and biology are the generally accepted benchmarks for reliable data. With that being said, I will not be quoting from Al Gore or Bill Nye, and will intentionally avoid any disreputable scientists who are assumed to be on the payroll of big oil or political parties with an obvious agenda or bias. With the disclaimer out of the way, if you have any additional credible sources or verifiable corrections that add weight to either side of the argument please comment below.&#10;&#10;Additional Resources:&#10;&#10;Free Booklet: Acts of God: Why Natural Disasters? - &#10;https://www.tomorrowsworld.org/booklets/acts-of-god-why-natural-disasters&#10;&#10;Tomorrow&#8217;s World Article&#8212;Here Comes the Sun: https://www.tomorrowsworld.org/magazines/2010/march-april/here-comes-the-sun&#10;&#10;Reference Links&#10;&#10;Chapter 1 &#8211; Carbon Dioxide&#10;Keeling Curve - https://scripps.ucsd.edu/programs/keelingcurve/&#10;NASA Proxy Data - https://climate.nasa.gov/vital-signs/carbon-dioxide/&#10;&#10;Chapter 2 &#8211; Global Temperatures&#10;Carbon Brief.org Datasets - https://www.carbonbrief.org/explainer-how-do-scientists-measure-global-temperature&#10;British Antarctic Survey - https://www.bas.ac.uk/data/our-data/publication/ice-cores-and-climate-change/&#10;Berkeley - http://berkeleyearth.org/understanding-adjustments-temperature-data/&#10;&#10;Chapter 3 &#8211; Correlation vs Causation&#10;Correlation vs Causation Argument Wikipedia - https://simple.wikipedia.org/wiki/Correlation&#10;&#8220;On the causal structure between CO2 and global temperature&#8221; https://www.nature.com/articles/srep21691&#10;&#8220;Global warming preceded by increasing carbon dioxide concentrations during the last deglaciation&#8221; http://www.atm.damtp.cam.ac.uk/mcintyre/shakun-co2-temp-lag-nat12.pdf&#10;&#10;Chapter 4 &#8211; Anthropogenic vs Natural Causes &#10;IPCC Fourth Assessment Report: Anthropogenic Climate Change https://www.ipcc.ch/publications_and_data/ar4/wg1/en/ch9s9-7.html &#10;&#10;Chapter 5 &#8211; Climate Models &#10;National Research Council - https://www.nap.edu/read/5142/chapter/7#493&#10;NOAA - El Nino and La Nina: https://oceanservice.noaa.gov/facts/ninonina.html &#10;NASA - Atmospheric Aerosols: https://www.nasa.gov/centers/langley/news/factsheets/Aerosols.html &#10;Live Science - 11 year cycle: https://www.livescience.com/33345-solar-cycle-sun-activity.html &#10;&#8220;Prediction Methods in Solar Sunspots Cycles&#8221; (https://www.nature.com/articles/srep21028) &#10;Anthropogenic climate change has delayed the next ice age: https://www.sciencealert.com/human-made-climate-change-has-suppressed-the-next-ice-age-researchers-say&#10;Computer Models - https://climatesight.org/2012/01/20/how-do-climate-models-work/&#10;The IPCC stated that &#8220;The climate system is a coupled non-linear chaotic system, and therefore the long-term prediction of future climate states is not possible.&#8221; https://www.ipcc.ch/ipccreports/tar/wg1/pdf/TAR-14.PDF&#10;&#10;Chapter 7 &#8211; Media, Politics and Industry&#10;NOAA - the frequency of hurricanes and tornadoes are decreasing, at least in the United States (https://www.ncdc.noaa.gov/climate-information/extreme-events/us-tornado-climatology/trends / http://www.cnsnews.com/news/article/barbara-hollingsworth/noaa-us-completes-record-breaking-11-years-without-major&#10;&#10;----------&#10;www.tomorrowsworld.org&#10;&#10;Viewpoint Archives - http://www.lcgCanada.org/viewpoint-archive.php&#10;&#10;Subscribe here:&#10;https://www.youtube.com/tomorrowsworldviewpoint&#10;&#10;#carbondioxide #climatechange #hoax"
    channeltitle "Tomorrow's World Viewpoint"
