    id 376
    label "rRAX9jsyCoY"
    step 0
    date "2019-10-24T17:37:13Z"
    title "New Zealand Tomorrow: Climate Change"
    description "New Zealand is a natural paradise, often described as the adventure capital of the world. Generations of Kiwis have been known for their love of the outdoors and are proud of our &#8216;Clean Green&#8217; image. That may now be under threat. &#10;&#10;This movie is a high school social action project. With permission to use footage from a couple of high quality outdoor filmmakers, a mid-spring ski trip was undertaken to Turoa ski field in the Central North Island. Members of the public were approached randomly, and given the opportunity to express their views. These were blended with an original soundtrack to produce what you now see. &#10;&#10;Special thanks to Martin Heck (Timestorm Films) and Milosh Kitchovitch (Amazing Places on Our Planet) for allowing the use of their incredible New Zealand footage. &#10;Timestorm Films: https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCqOecsBLULnuUtls0tISTCw&#10;Amazing Places on Our Planet: https://www.youtube.com/user/milosh9k&#10;&#10;If you are interested, further information can be found at Protect Our Winters New Zealand who kindly gave permission for their logo to be associated with this project.&#10;https://protectourwinters.nz/&#10;&#10;You may want to check out their social media: https://www.facebook.com/ProtectOurWintersNZ/&#10;&#10;The original soundtrack Twilight is available for free use, please credit to Piwakawaka&#10;https://soundcloud.com/user-823774181/twilight &#10;&#10;.....................................................................................................................&#10;&#10;Disclaimer:&#10;&#10;The views expressed in this film do not necessarily reflect the opinions of Timestorm Films, Amazing Places on Our Planet, Protect Our Winters New Zealand, Ruapehu Alpine Lifts or of Piwakawaka Productions.&#10;&#10;References:&#10;https://www.mfe.govt.nz/climate-change/state-of-our-atmosphere-and-climate/new-zealands-greenhouse-gas-inventory&#10;https://www.stuff.co.nz/environment/climate-news/109053475/new-zealands-outsized-climate-change-contribution&#10;https://niwa.co.nz/atmosphere/faq/what-are-greenhouse-gases&#10;https://www.mfe.govt.nz/node/16596&#10;https://niwa.co.nz/natural-hazards/hazards/climate-change"
    channeltitle "P&#299;wakawaka Productions"
