    date "2022-06-04T14:30:26Z"
    title "Climate Change SOLUTION: Life in Oceans  | Ayushkaari"
    description "What is Climate Change? Global Warming in Hindi | IPCC report 2022 | Definition of Environmental Problem? | Solution of Climate Change&#10;&#10;Climate Change is already causing Heatwaves and messy Weather. It&#8217;s going to make things worse in future. What do we do? How do we stop Global Warming? Out of many, one answer is hidden in our Oceans. We are trying to discuss a few strategies of Geo-Engineering. How do we Refreeze the Poles? How do Ocean Carbon Sinks work? Watch this video to know in all.&#10;&#10;&#2342;&#2375;&#2326;&#2379;, &#2360;&#2381;&#2341;&#2367;&#2340;&#2367; &#2348;&#2361;&#2369;&#2340; &#2348;&#2369;&#2352;&#2368; &#2361;&#2379;&#2344;&#2375; &#2357;&#2366;&#2354;&#2368; &#2361;&#2376;. &#2311;&#2360; &#2348;&#2366;&#2340; &#2325;&#2379; &#2327;&#2306;&#2349;&#2368;&#2352;&#2340;&#2366; &#2360;&#2375; &#2354;&#2375;&#2344;&#2366; &#2361;&#2379;&#2327;&#2366;. &#2351;&#2361;&#2368; &#2319;&#2335;&#2368;&#2335;&#2381;&#2351;&#2370;&#2337; &#2352;&#2361;&#2366;, &#2340;&#2379; &#2360;&#2348;&#2325;&#2375; &#2354;&#2327; &#2332;&#2366;&#2319;&#2306;&#2327;&#2375; &#2348;&#2369;&#2352;&#2375; &#2357;&#2366;&#2354;&#2375;. &#2325;&#2381;&#2354;&#2366;&#2311;&#2350;&#2375;&#2335; &#2330;&#2375;&#2306;&#2332; &#2325;&#2379; &#2354;&#2375;&#2325;&#2352; &#2337;&#2352; &#2325;&#2366; &#2350;&#2366;&#2361;&#2380;&#2354; &#2361;&#2376;. &#2354;&#2375;&#2325;&#2367;&#2344; &#2311;&#2360;&#2325;&#2366; &#2360;&#2377;&#2354;&#2381;&#2351;&#2370;&#2358;&#2344; &#2325;&#2381;&#2351;&#2366; &#2361;&#2376;? &#2360;&#2360;&#2369;&#2352;&#2375; &#2360;&#2366;&#2354;&#2381;&#2351;&#2370;&#2358;&#2344; &#2346;&#2352; &#2348;&#2361;&#2369;&#2340; &#2325;&#2350; &#2348;&#2366;&#2340; &#2361;&#2379;&#2340;&#2368; &#2361;&#2376;. &#2360;&#2366;&#2311;&#2306;&#2335;&#2367;&#2360;&#2381;&#2335; &#2354;&#2379;&#2327; &#2325;&#2312; &#2325;&#2381;&#2352;&#2366;&#2306;&#2340;&#2367;&#2325;&#2366;&#2352;&#2368; &#2360;&#2369;&#2333;&#2366;&#2357; &#2342;&#