eFacts #Science&#10;#Sciencekaari&#10;&#10;=============================================&#10;&#10;If you enjoy my videos, follow me.&#10;&#10;Instagram : https://www.instagram.com/ayushkaari &#10;&#10;Facebook : https://www.facebook.com/ayushkaari.fb/ &#10;&#10;Twitter : https://twitter.com/ayushkaari &#10;&#10;Youtube : https://www.youtube.com/c/Ayushkaari &#10;&#10;Telegram : http://t.me/ayushkaari&#10;&#10;=============================================&#10;About us:&#10;&#10;Ayush Yadav graduated from IIT Guwahati in 2019 . After graduation , he started working with The Lallantop . Lallantop's Editor Saurabh Dwivedi appointed him Science Editor of Lallantop . Ayush hosts a weekly Science Show on Lallantop - Sciencekaari.&#10;&#10;&#2310;&#2351;&#2369;&#2359; &#2351;&#2366;&#2342;&#2357; &#2344;&#2366;&#2350;&#2325; &#2348;&#2366;&#2354;&#2325; 2019 &#2350;&#2375;&#2306; IIT &#2327;&#2369;&#2357;&#2366;&#2361;&#2366;&#2335;&#2368; &#2360;&#2375; &#2327;&#2381;&#2352;&#2376;&#2332;&#2369;&#2319;&#2335; &#2361;&#2369;&#2310; . &#2332;&#2376;&#2360;&#2375; - &#2340;&#2376;&#2360;&#2375; &#2361;&#2379; &#2327;&#2351;&#2366; &#2360;&#2350;&#2333;&#2379; . &#2313;&#2360;&#2325;&#2375; &#2348;&#2366;&#2342; &#2311;&#2360;&#2344;&#2375; &#2342;&#2368; &#2354;&#2354;&#2381;&#2354;&#2344;&#2335;&#2377;&#2346; &#2325;&#2375; &#2360;&#2366;&#2341; &#2354;&#2375;&#2326; &#2332;&#2379;&#2340;&#2344;&#2366; &#2358;&#2369;&#2352;&#2370; &#2325;&#2367;&#2351;&#2366; . &#2360;&#2306;&#2346;&#2366;&#2342;&#2325; &#2360;&#2380;&#2352;&#2349; &#2342;&#2381;&#2357;&#2367;&#2357;&#2375;&#2342;&#2368; &#2325;&#2368; &#2342;&#2351;&#2366; , &#2325;&#2352;&#2370;&#2339;&#2366; &#2324;&#2352; &#2309;&#2360;&#2368;&#2350; &#2346;&#2381;&#2352;&#2375;&#2350; &#2344;&#2375; &#2310;&#2351;&#2369;&#2359; &#2325;&#2379; &#2354;&#2354;&#2381;&#2354;&#2344;&#2335;&#2377;&#2346; &#2325;&#2366; &#2360;&#2366;&#2311;&#2306;&#2360; &#2319;&#2337;&#2367;&#2335;&#2352; &#2348;&#2344;&#2366; &#2342;&#2367;