    title "Boiling Point 1: Climate Change Negotiations for Beginners"
    description "Are you new to COP? Do you want to know more about the inner workings of the UN climate negotiations and why they don't deliver on the climate crisis? Say no more - The Boiling Point series will answer everything you wanted to know about the climate change negotiations but were too afraid to ask!&#10;&#10;The first session with Dorothy Guerrero from Global Justice Now and Doreen Stabinsky, College of the Atlantic, will introduce basic concepts and terms, provide a brief overview of the process, and pose questions which we will explore over the course of the series. &#10;&#10;The Boiling Point series will run weekly on Thursdays from 17th September through 22nd October. &#10;&#10;Register here: https://www.eventbrite.co.uk/e/boiling-point-a-cop26-coalition-speaker-series-tickets-115978245053"
