    id 411
    label "GtKtM6tY164"
    step 0
    date "2022-06-26T13:19:15Z"
    title "Natural disasters. M6.1 Earthquake  Afghanistan. Floods, hail, tornadoes in Europe. Climate crisis"
    description "Natural disasters. M6.1 Earthquake &#8594; Afghanistan. Floods, hail, tornadoes in Europe. Climate crisis&#10;JUNE 21, 2022&#10;AFGHANISTAN. A strong and very destructive earthquake struck a mountainous area near the border with Pakistan. Unfortunately, more than 1,500 people died and about 2,000 were injured. Many people still remain buried underground.&#10;This earthquake was the most powerful in the country in the last 20 years. Earth tremors were felt in other parts of the country, as well as in Pakistan and India.&#10;&#10;Watch this and more in the new episode of Breaking News.&#10;&#10;The abnormal heat wave from March to May 2022 in India broke many records: &#10;-It was the hottest March on record. &#10;-This was followed by the hottest April in 50 years. &#10;-May was also unseasonably hot. &#10;According to the Times of India, in the state of Maharashtra, mortality from heatstroke was the highest in six years, with dozens of people losing their lives in just the past few months due to record heat waves.&#10;&#10;MID JUNE 2022. &#10;NORTHEAST INDIA. The monsoon season caused widespread flooding and landslides. Unfortunately, dozens of people died, and there are those missing. The disaster affected the lives of more than 30 million people. One and a half million residents were forced to leave their homes.&#10;&#10;At the same time.&#10;BANGLADESH. A lot of casualties were reportedpeople died because of the disaster, and there are people those missing. More than a hundred thousand people lost their homes. &#10;Roads were flooded or washed out, evacuation of people was possible only on boats, which were sorely lacking. &#10;The floods in this region were the worst and most destructive over the last 122 years. &#10;&#10;JUNE 18, 2022&#10;CHINA, A powerful tornado swept through the Foshan metropolitan area. Homes and industrial buildings were damaged. &#10;At the same time, catastrophic flooding caused by torrential rains continues in the southern regions of the country. More than 200,000 people have been evacuated, and there are people missing. Thousands of people wereare trapped in water. These are the heaviest downpours in 60 years.&#10;&#10;JUNE 18-19 &#10;FRANCE. A powerful storm swept along the coast of the department of Calvados. &#10;Everything happened very abruptly! In a matter of minutes the temperature dropped by almost 15 degrees Celsius, the sky darkened quickly, and the strongest gusts of wind forced vacationers on the beach to flee and seek shelter. There were casuslfatalities. Dozens of people were injured.&#10;&#10;In mid-June 2022, a stream of hot air from North Africa brought a sweltering heatwave to Europe. Maximum daily records were broken in Spain, France, Italy and Britain. &#10;In Spain, abnormal heat, drought and strong winds triggered dozens of wildfires in 11 provinces.&#10;&#10;From June 17 to 23, floods and hail storms swept across Europe, Asia, Africa and the Americas.&#10;Homes, roads and, cars, and flooded farmland were damaged. Farmlands were flooded.&#10;&#10;In a consumer society, fragmentation and bureaucratic procedures do not effectively save millions of lives.&#10;There must be a single, global rescue service, a very rapid response, which will allow competent coordination of specialists and the rapid deployment of the necessary equipment to save billions of lives! Including yours!&#10;All this is only possible in thea Creative Society.&#10;&#10;Creative Society for each and everyone. Do you understand? This is the paradox of the Creative Society. It is for all of us, but at the same time it is first of all for you. It's the format that can make your life beautiful, happy and absolutely safe.&#10;&#10;And now an important stage of its construction is taking place - the stage of informing. If we don't tell people about it now, we'll lose time. &#1040;nd tomorrow there will be nobody to tell and no one to help you. It's important to get this information out to everyone now, so that you and your family can survive tomorrow.&#10;&#10;GLOBAL CRISIS. WE ARE PEOPLE. WE WANT TO LIVE | International Online Forum | May 7th, 2022&#10;https://youtu.be/d2Pk8eHdZRk&#10; &#10;Official website of the Creative Society project: &#10;https://creativesociety.com&#10; &#10;Creative Society. Questions and Answers&#10;https://youtu.be/IdXHvwwAqmU&#10;&#10;Email: info@creativesociety.com&#10;&#10;#flood&#8203;&#8203;&#8203;&#8203;&#8203;&#8203;&#8203;&#8203;&#8203;&#8203;&#8203;&#8203;&#8203;&#8203;&#8203; &#10;#Climatecrisis &#10;#afghanistanearthquake &#10;#tornado&#8203;&#8203;&#8203;&#8203;&#8203;&#8203;&#8203;&#8203;&#8203;&#8203;&#8203;&#8203;&#8203;&#8203;&#8203; &#10;#storm &#10;#heat &#10;#naturaldisasters &#10;#climatechange &#10;#climatecrisis&#10;#caughtoncamera"
