    date "2022-02-07T20:15:35Z"
    title "The Suburbs Are Bleeding America Dry | Climate Town (feat. Not Just Bikes)"
    description "We&#8217;ve got to rethink housing, brotherrr! Patreon: https://www.patreon.com/ClimateTown&#10;sUbScRiBe FoR mOrE ViDeOs: https://www.youtube.com/c/climatetown?sub_confirmation=1&#10;&#10;Check out the Not Just Bikes version right here: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=cO6txCZpbsQ&#10;&#10;CLIMATE TOWN DIGITAL SPRAWL:&#10;Discord - https://discord.gg/A5Czqfgr4C&#10;Instagram - https://www.instagram.com/climatetown&#10;Twitter - https://twitter.com/ClimateTown&#10;TikTok - https://www.tiktok.com/@climatetown&#10;Patreon: https://www.patreon.com/ClimateTown&#10;&#10;CHANNELS THAT ARE BOTH GREAT AND RELEVANT :&#10;Not Just Bikes - https://www.youtube.com/c/NotJustBikes &#10;City Beautiful - https://www.youtube.com/c/CityBeautiful&#10;       &#10;ZONING STUFF YOU CAN DO&#10;1) Join our Discord. Since there&#8217;s not a great/accessible database of everyone&#8217;s local zoning meetings (as far as we could find), we think it would be pretty slick to harness our community&#8217;s collective power to make it easier to get this information. We just created a channel called &#8220;#zoning&#8221; (https://discord.gg/cqRpTpeAH2), where you can drop by and tell us how your local zoning meeting smelled, or share a link that we missed to help others affect change in their community. (And in case you&#8217;re like me from a month ago and have no idea how to use Discord, here&#8217;s a helpful beginner&#8217;s guide - https://support.discord.com/hc/en-us/articles/360045138571-Beginner-s-Guide- to-Discord)&#10;&#10;2) Sign up for Public Comment Workshop from YIMBY Action - Feb 15, 2022 5pm Pacific: https://us02web.zoom.us/meeting/register/tZAtc--sqD4oGNCRb8_38HT3Qb92wmXHceVS&#10;&#10;3) City Specific Zoning or Board Meeting Links:&#10;Los Angeles: https://planning.lacity.org/about/commissions-boards-hearings&#10;New York City: https://www1.nyc.gov/site/cau/community-boards/community-boards.page&#10;Chicago: https://www.thecha.org/about/board-meetings-agendas-and-resolutions/board-information-and-meetings&#10;4) Don&#8217;t see your city? They&#8217;re often hyper-local, a little hard to find, and go by different names. Search your &#8216;zip/town/city&#8217;  and these search terms: &#10;&#10;Community Board Meeting&#10;City Planning Board Meeting&#10;City Planning Commission&#10;Zoning Committee Meeting&#10;Community Engagement Meeting&#10;Public Consultation (Canada)&#10;YIMBY (Yes, In My Back Yard) &#10;Housing Reform Groups&#10;Density Advocacy&#10;       &#10;5) Join or donate to a zoning-focused organization:&#10;https://yimbyaction.org/2021/&#10;https://smartgrowthamerica.org/&#10;https://www.strongtowns.org/&#10;https://cayimby.org/ (California)&#10;https://abundanthousingla.org/ (Los Angeles)&#10;https://carlaef.org/ (California)&#10;https://www.opennewyork.city/ (NYC)&#10;https://yimbydenver.org/about-us/ (Denver)&#10;https://www.seattleforgrowth.org/ (Seattle) &#10;https://actionnetwork.org/groups/neighbors-for-more-neighbors-metro-atlanta (Atlanta) &#10;https://www.orlandoyimby.org/ (Orlando)&#10;https://www.desegregatect.org/ (Connecticut)&#10;https://ahvan.org/ (Vancouver)&#10;https://yimbyalliance.org/ (UK)&#10;        &#10;ARTICLES GALORE&#10;&#10;https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2018-09-06/nimbys-dominate-local-zoning-meetings&#10;https://www.strongtowns.org/journal/2020/7/7/abolish-single-family-zoning&#10;https://www.theamericanconservative.com/urbs/its-time-to-abolish-single-family-zoning/&#10;https://liherald.com/stories/hochul-end-zoning-focus-on-single-families,138311&#10;https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2022-02-02/how-to-make-an-atlas-that-reveals-the-mysteries-of-zoning&#10;https://www.theolympian.com/news/state/washington/article256627801.html&#10;https://mass.streetsblog.org/2022/01/13/new-state-rule-would-force-suburbs-to-legalize-thousands-of-new-apartments-near-t-stops/&#10;&#10;SOURCES:&#10;Georgetown Public Policy Review on GH gases and zoning: http://gppreview.com/2019/11/05/green-houses-greenhouse-gases-exclusionary-zoning-climate-catastrophe/&#10;ASCE Emissions Analysis: https://ascelibrary.org/doi/10.1061/%28ASCE%290733-9488%282006%29132%3A1%2810%29&#10;Carbon &#38; Road Construction: https://www.researchgate.net/publication/332492697_Carbon_Footprint_Estimation_in_Road_Construction_La_Abundancia-Florencia_Case_Study&#10;City safety and density: https://science.time.com/2013/07/23/in-town-versus-country-it-turns-out-that-cities-are-the-safest-places-to-live/&#10;Household energy by density: https://www.pnas.org/content/117/32/19122#ref-3&#10;R1 Zoning Impact: https://www.tandfonline.com/doi/full/10.1080/01944363.2019.1651216&#10;&#10;An economic history of Zoning: https://www.jstor.org/stable/43100684&#10;&#10;New York Times on Zoning Reform: https://www.nytimes.com/interactive/2019/06/18/upshot/cities-across-america-question-single-family-zoning.html&#10;&#10;Historical zoning: &#10;Iowa Dept of public affairs: https://iowaculture.gov/history/education/educator-resources/primary-source-sets/great-migration/white-tenants-our-white&#10;UC Berkley https://escholarship.org/content/qt26b8d8zh/qt26b8d8zh.pdf?t=poq62p&#38;v=lg&#10;KQED: https://www.kqed.org/news/11840548/the-racist-history-of-single-family-home-zoning&#10;&#10;Intro animation by Ian MK Cessna - ianhasawebsite.com&#10;Shot by Nicole Conlan&#10;Written by Rollie Williams, Jason Slaughter, Ben Boult, Nicole Conlan"
