    id 483
    label "NJ7W6HFHPYs"
    step 0
    date "2022-04-21T20:20:50Z"
    title "What Your Bank Really Does With Your Money | Climate Town"
    description "Thanks, banks! Patreon: https://www.patreon.com/ClimateTown &#10;sUbScRiBe FoR mOrE ViDeOs: https://www.youtube.com/c/climatetown... &#10;&#10;Learn more about what we can do at https://www.climatetownproductions.com/banking &#38; connect with the Climate Town community over on our new #banking Discord channel [https://discord.gg/WwuJ4ghzAf]&#10;&#10;CLIMATE TOWN DIGITAL SPRAWL&#10;Patreon - https://www.patreon.com/ClimateTown &#10;Discord - https://discord.gg/A5Czqfgr4C &#10;Instagram - https://www.instagram.com/climatetown &#10;Twitter - https://twitter.com/ClimateTown &#10;TikTok - https://www.tiktok.com/@climatetown &#10;LinkedIn - https://www.linkedin.com/company/climate-town&#10;LinkTree - https://linktr.ee/ClimateTown &#10;&#10;SPECIAL THANKS: Atmos Financial, Rainforest Action Network, Sierra Club, Stop The Money Pipeline&#10;&#10;Written by Ben Boult, Rollie Williams, Matt Nelsen &#38; Nicole Conlan&#10;Shot by Nicole Conlan&#10;Intro Animation by Ian MK Cessna&#10;&#10;STUFF YOU CAN DO&#10;1) GET ON SOCIAL MEDIA and let these banks know you&#8217;ve had enough. Write a little note to tell them how you feel. Get creative. But maybe something like: 'Hey guy, I noticed you&#8217;re loaning billions of your customers&#8217; dollars to the fossil fuel industry. I don&#8217;t like that. And if you don&#8217;t stop right away, I&#8217;m taking my money and going home.' &#10;&#10;Oh, and FIRE UP THESE HASHTAGS &#38; HANDLES: &#10;#DontBankOnIt #StopTheMoneyPipeline #BankingOnClimateChaos #NoMoreDirtyBanks #CustomersForClimateJustice #EarthDay2022 #InvestInOurPlanet #BetterBanking&#10;Tag the banks: @Chase @Citi @WellsFargo @BankOfAmerica @MorganStanley @GoldmanSachs&#10;&#10;2) If you don&#8217;t want your money financing oil &#38; gas companies, SWITCH YOUR BANK.&#10;Look into climate friendly regional banks and credit unions with transparent lending policies, or take a look at options like Atmos [https://www.joinatmos.com/] that actively finance climate solutions. Be aware of greenwashing, and check out https://mightydeposits.com/posts/environmentally-friendly-banks and https://bankforgood.org for even more options. &#10;&#10;3) PROTEST. LEARN. SIGN THINGS. Get educated &#38; mAkE nOiSe. &#10;Check out the links below, and visit https://www.climatetownproductions.com/banking for more info about petitions, actions, and resources we think are the bees&#8217; knees. &#10;&#10;MOVEMENTS &#38; CAMPAIGNS: &#10;https://www.bankingonclimatechaos.org/&#10;https://stopthemoneypipeline.com/&#10;https://stopthemoneypipeline.com/moment-of-truth/&#10;https://bank.green/&#10;https://www.nomoredirtybanks.com/&#10;http://www.customersforclimatejustice.com/&#10;https://www.earthday.org/earth-day-2022/&#10;https://fossilbanks.org/ &#10;https://www.iccr.org/2022-climate-finance-resolutions &#10;&#10;SOURCES: &#10;https://www.bankingonclimatechaos.org/&#10;https://www.iea.org/reports/net-zero-by-2050&#10;https://www.jpmorgan.com/solutions/cib/investment-banking/center-for-carbon-transition/carbon-compass&#10;https://www.unepfi.org/net-zero-banking/members/&#10;https://www.bloombergquint.com/onweb/jpmorgan-joins-net-zero-banking-alliance-with-emissions-pledge&#10;https://www.hindawi.com/journals/complexity/2017/1967645/&#10;https://www.bankofthewest.com/ &#10;https://www.the-numbers.com/movies/franchise/Toy-Story#tab=summary &#10;https://www.reuters.com/business/sustainable-business/french-lender-banque-postale-commits-exit-oil-gas-by-2030-2021-10-14/&#10;https://ampvideo.bnnbloomberg.ca/la-banque-postale-unveils-plan-to-exit-oil-and-gas-by-2030-1.1666400&#10;https://www.nytimes.com/2016/09/15/business/dealbook/wells-fargo-investigation.html&#10;https://www.npr.org/2016/09/26/495501008/wells-fargos-unauthorized-accounts-likely-hurt-customers-credit-scores&#10;&#10;MORE NEWS &#38; PRESS&#10;https://qz.com/2148206/the-ukraine-crisis-could-impede-banks-from-dropping-fossil-fuels/&#10;https://www.reuters.com/business/sustainable-business/worlds-top-banks-pumped-742-bln-into-fossil-fuels-2021-report-2022-03-30/&#10;https://www.ft.com/content/3eeee0f7-bb02-4950-a6d6-49da39c3cc41&#10;https://www.marketwatch.com/story/pouring-gasoline-on-the-fire-jpmorgan-citi-and-other-u-s-banks-lead-rise-in-lending-to-oil-and-gas-report-11648642894&#10;https://www.bnnbloomberg.ca/bankers-are-still-standing-behind-the-dirtiest-fossil-fuel-1.1744979&#10;https://www.teenvogue.com/story/banks-fund-climate-change&#10;https://www.nationalobserver.com/2021/08/11/news/paris-was-signed-our-banks-have-funded-climate-chaos-tune-700b&#10;https://www.propublica.org/article/the-celebrity-backed-green-fintech-company-that-isnt-as-green-as-it-seems&#10;https://www.sierraclub.org/sierra/many-banks-committing-climate-goals-are-engaging-greenwashing-banking-on-climate-chaos"
