    title "1 Climate Change - Introduction"
    description "@Guide My Career - Meteorology and Oceanography This video describes the basic difference between and weather and climate, what is climate change, major drivers, causes and consequences of climate change specially from oceans' perspective. You can see major impacts of climate change specially from oceans' perspective such as 1. Ocean warming, 2. Melting of Ice, 3. Sea Level Rise, 4. Ocean Circulation, 5. extreme marine and weather events (storms, heavy rains, marine heat waves, ENSO, NAO), 6. Coastal Ecosystem (mangroves, salt marshes, and sea grasses, coastal flooding and erosion, saltwater erosion), 7. Marine Ecosystem (marine species migration, changes in the diversity and abundance of species), 8. Ocean Acidification(Coral Bleaching, Plankton and Shellfish), 9 Hypoxia-Deoxygenation(ocean dead zones)"
