    title "Pacific Child Website Launch and PRC4ECD Commitment to Climate Change"
    description "Young Pacific children have spoken and leaders of the reigon have heard their call: &#10;&#10;For a climate resilient future, we must invest in early childhood development now. &#10;&#10;In the margins of the 51st Pacific Islands Forum Leaders Meeting in Suva, Fiji (12-14 July 2022), Forum Chair and Fiji Prime Minister Hon Josaia Voreqe Bainimarama and Samoa Prime Minister Hon Afioga Fiame Naomi Mata'afa officiated at the Pacific Child Website Launch and the PRC4ECD Commitment to Climate Change. &#10;&#10;The childrens' message was loud and clear when the students of Mobile Kindy Fiji and Pacific Climate Warrior mother-daughter duo Alisi Rabukawaqa-Nacewa and 8-year-old Aiyanna Nacewa, shared their perspectives with Pacific leaders on the importance of early childhood development as part of building a thriving society. &#10;&#10;For more, visit the Pacific Child website: www.pacific-child.org."
    channeltitle "Pacific Regional Council for ECD"
    channelid "UCueE341CZcKZisgo0YIwDHw"
