    description "The objective of Going Green is to simplify the often-complicated world of sustainability.&#10;&#10;We all know that we need to use less, recycle more and be kinder to our planet but how else can play a part, when messages of sustainability sometimes get lost in scientific language, which means very little to most of us.&#10;&#10;In this video, we explain the causes of climate change and show you ways you can do your bit to help limit the damage.&#10;&#10;Visit www.ukgoinggreen.com for simple how-to guides, training, grant information and to join the Going Green community."
