    label "RDt6DY5zWFQ"
    step 0
    date "2022-04-22T16:12:24Z"
    title "BURNED: Ben Shapiro Destroys Climate Change Argument"
    description "It's hard to call something a &#34;crisis&#34; when the climate debate has lasted for multiple decades and we've yet to see the effects the Left promises will happen. Ben Shapiro tackles this leftist's climate change argument during the Q&#38;A at University of North Carolina-Greensboro."
    channeltitle "Young America's Foundation"
    channelid "UC4-AGCUwX7C-D4BsBook9fQ"
    favcount 0
    viewcount 1218186
    likecount 34807
    commentcount 9018
    duration "PT3M59S"
    indegree 0
