  [
    id 542
    label "roiuDMyypcQ"
    step 0
    date "2021-11-12T17:45:03Z"
    title "Bjorn Lomborg: 7 myths about climate change"
    description "The Danish academic challenges common misconceptions.&#10;&#10;Listen to the podcast version of the full interview here: https://shows.acast.com/lockdowntv-with-freddie-sayers/bjorn-lomborg-climate-change-is-not-the-end-of-the-world&#10;&#10;As the COP26 summit meets over the next couple of weeks in Glasgow, we can all expect to be bombarded with disaster scenarios, replete with stories about our species&#8217; imminent demise. Over the last couple of days, we have had Boris Johnson warning that it is &#8220;one minute to midnight&#8221; and Prince Charles claiming that this is &#8220;literally our last chance saloon&#8221;. And of course, Greta Thunberg has already made a few appearances of her own, accusing politicians of &#8220;pretending to take our future seriously&#8221; and saying that COP26 will &#8220;lead us nowhere&#8221;.&#10;&#10;Bjorn Lomborg takes a different view. His latest book, &#8216;False Alarm: how climate change panic costs us trillions, hurts the poor, and fails to fix the planet&#8217; sets out his argument that, although climate change is a real problem and is mostly man-made, the panic and alarmism is counter-productive. He spoke to Freddie Sayers.&#10;&#10;// Timecodes //&#10;&#10;00:00 - 01:39 - Myth 1: small islands are doomed&#10;01:39 - 03:09 - Myth 2: extreme weather is on the rise&#10;03:09 - 04:39 - Myth 3: climate lockdowns are the solution&#10;04:39 - 06:00 -  Myth 4: electric cars will save us &#10;06:00 - 07:17 - Myth 5: polar bears are dying out&#10;07:17 - 08:05 - Myth 6: cutting out meat will save the planet&#10;08:05 - 10:32 - Myth 7: increasing wildfires&#10;&#10;#BjornLomborg #ClimateChange #COP26"
    channeltitle "UnHerd"
    channelid "UCMxiv15iK_MFayY_3fU9loQ"
    favcount 0
    viewcount 35590
    likecount 2012
    commentcount 534
    duration "PT10M33S"
    indegree 0
    ppinsult 0.32379264
    ppflirtation 0.30443224
    ppidentityattack 0.16277005
    ppthreat 0.2636737
    pptoxicity 0.0121478075
    ppsexuallyexplicit 0.12189201
    ppprofanity 0.2657611
    ppinflammatory 0.121931754
    sentiment 0
    cluster 3
  ]
